Package: share-wifi
Version: 1.2.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: policykit-1, python3, python3-gi, python3-qrcode, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, network-manager
Maintainer: Share Wi-Fi <maintainer@localhost>
Description: Share saved Wi-Fi networks with a scannable QR code
 Select a saved NetworkManager Wi-Fi connection, view its password,
 and display a QR code that phones can scan to join the network.
 Credentials are processed locally and are not written to disk.
